title: "Transboundary Freshwater Agreements and Hydro-Climatic Intelligence Portal"
abstract: "A spatio-temporal database and interactive platform synthesizing over 3,000 international transboundary freshwater treaties (1820–2024), the Basins at Risk (BAR) conflict-cooperation event set, and ECMWF ERA5 historical climate reanalysis."
